ull,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_14","text":"What, are you still her lackey?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"stall3rd","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_15","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_16","text":"Then why the hell do you care?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_17","text":"Do you even know how much it pissed me off?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_18","text":"Watching this nobody bark orders at you like you're her servant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"stall3rd","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_19","text":"I was getting paid, so I was fine with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_20","text":"Oh, so money makes it all okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"stall3rd","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_21","text":"Mm-hmm. Back when she had money, you didn't make a peep either. Remember?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"stall3rd","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_23","text":"So yeah, with enough money, anything goes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_24","text":"Ugh... But seriously she's so useless. Can she even do anything?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"stall3rd","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_25","text":"She said she knows a bit about computers and electronic devices.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"freerat","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_26","text":"Real fitting skills for a precious princess like you, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"princess","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_43_05_27","text":"Enough. Forget it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_43_05